        "input": "2\n5 3\n2 4 6 9 11 \n1 1 4 4 1\n7 1\n2 3 4 6 8 9 10 \n3 3 3 2 5 9 7",
        "output": "YES\nNO",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: Chef will plant the bomb at X=6X = 6X=6. This causes the monsters at positions 4,6,4, 6,4,6, and 999 to die immediately. Then,\n\nAt t=1t = 1t=1, Chef shoots the 1th1^{th}1th monster. This kills it.\nThen, the fifth monster moves one step closer, to position 101010.\nAt t=2t = 2t=2, Chef shoots the 5th5^{th}5th monster. This kills it.\nAll the monsters are now dead, so Chef wins.\n\nTest case 222: No matter where Chef plants the bomb, he cannot win."
